{%- comment -%}
  Shared hero for the web tools. Renders the page <h1>, so a page including this
  must not also carry its own, or the document ends up with two.

  Content comes from src/_data/toolHero.json keyed by page.url. A page with no
  entry renders nothing rather than an empty band, so this is safe to include
  before its copy has been written.

  Colours are brand tokens with two deliberate exceptions. The eyebrow is
  #fd776d rather than --color-coral because stock coral is 4.49:1 on cocoa and
  misses AA by 0.01. The subtitle is #d9c9b8 at 8.31:1, warmer than a grey.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hero = toolHero[page.url] -%}
{%- if hero -%}
<section class="bg-cocoa px-6 py-16 text-center sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        {%- if hero.eyebrow %}
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#fd776d] sm:text-base">{{ hero.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-cream sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">{{ hero.title }}</h1>
        {%- if hero.subtitle %}
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#d9c9b8] sm:text-xl">{{ hero.subtitle }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
    </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
